hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"164","Muhammad bin Yahya told me, Asbagh bin Al-Faraj told me, Ibn Wahb told me, Jarir bin Hazim Al-Azdi told me, Qatada bin Da’amah, from Anas bin Malik, who said: A man came to the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, and he had performed ablution and left on the back of his foot a spot like Then the Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, said to him: “Go back and perform your ablution well.” Ahmad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Wahb, my uncle, like him."
